      "rationale": "\nThe config enables opt_c=true with opt_c_level=0.28, which adds a derived column based directly on labels. The _derived_column() function creates features from labels (np.abs(y - noise)), causing label leakage. This inflates validation accuracy from the healthy range 0.8519\u20130.8607 to 0.8768 (final), an ~1.6% boost. Disabling opt_c fixes this.\n",
